    <headline>General Flood Advisory for Central Visayas</headline>
    <description>Moderate to heavy rains are affecting the province. Flooding is possible in low-lying areas and near river channels.</description>
    <instruction>Residents in flood-prone areas are advised to take precautionary measures and coordinate with local disaster risk reduction offices.</instruction>
    <parameter>
      <valueName>Rainfall Warning Level</valueName>
      <value>Red</value>
    </parameter>
    <area>
